            (instances (project "Atlas2350" (path "/883781a9-80cf-5ef9-9dac-fb167852f095" (page "6")))))(text "Wi-Fi / BLE UART coprocessor and programming" (at 161 161 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "13994395-459b-51ce-8bea-5e8c5dea5ca8"))(text "Atlas2350 Rev A | 80 x 75mm, four layers, 1.6mm FR-4, ENIG\nAll components top-side; PCBWay includes SMT and through-hole connectors.\nFabrication: 0.127mm clearance, 0.15mm signal width, 0.30mm drills / 0.60mm vias.\nFilled/capped through vias required at QFN exposed pads and module thermal pad." (at 35 31 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "e63e1438-4cb0-5aa4-b374-67dd8854de37"))(text "DECISIONS\n3.3V buck-boost powers MCU, memories, SD and radio from USB or LiPo.\nExternal 1.1V LDO avoids the RP2350 internal buck magnetic-polarity/layout dependency.\nExternal 3-wire protected battery required: BAT+, GND, 10k NTC. No battery or microSD card in assembly BOM.\nWi-Fi/BLE is an ESP32-C3 coprocessor, not native RP2350 functionality; firmware required.\nFactory assemble every BOM row. Mechanical holes and bare test pads are not components.\nNo DNI/DNP component options. See README and fab/assembly-notes.md before ordering." (at 35 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "5d19db59-50aa-5b3f-aa0f-9c3d292794c9"))(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
